   "subject": "Re: How to remove NA in the legend?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">use `scale_color_manual` to set the `breaks` that exclude `NA`.</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
